    <briefdescription>
<para>A set of live virtual registers and physical register units. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is a wrapper around a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_sparse_set" kindref="compound">SparseSet</ref> which deals with mapping register unit and virtual register indexes to an index usable by the sparse set. </para>
